{"id":"00458","root":"uni00458_1","name":{"ja":"上月　佐那","en":"Kozuki Sana"},"title":{"ja":"【ミストレス】","en":"【Mistress】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ミストレス】 上月　佐那","en":"【Mistress】 Kozuki Sana"},"aliases":["Sana"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2021-05-17","limited":true,"characterId":135,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。秋山凜子と同じ逸刀流の剣士。分派の道場で師範代を務める天才剣客として知られる。行雲流水を装うが、実は人知れず鍛錬に励む努力家である。趣味はパチスロ・競馬・日サロ・酒・タバコ。これらも当初は無頼を演じるために始めたのだが、根が真面目なため“偽装”にも真面目に取り組んでしまい、今では本当の趣味になっている模様。非番の時はよくジャージ姿でパチスロをうっている。規律を重んじる先輩剣客たちからの小言は絶えないが、腕が立つため後輩からは尊敬を集めている。酒遁の術（しゅとんのじゅつ）の使い手で、忍法“ストロングスタイル”は酔えば酔うほど第六感が強化され神霊の加護を得るという術。酔っぱらいながら敵の攻撃を見切り、弱点を看破する上、限界を超えた力を発揮し、恐ろしく打たれ強くなる。リリス・スーパーストロングというチューハイを愛飲しており、いつも持ち歩いている。酒を飲むとチョロくなるのが玉に瑕。","en":"She is a Taimanin and a swordswoman of the Ittō-ryū style, like Akiyama Rinko. She serves as deputy headmaster at a branch dojo and is known as a genius swordswoman. She pretends to be carefree, but secretly trains hard. Her hobbies are pachislot, horse racing, sunbathing, drinking, and smoking. She started these to play a rogue, but her earnest nature made them real hobbies. Off duty she often plays pachislot in a tracksuit. Senior swordsmen constantly scold her for discipline, yet juniors respect her skill. She wields the alcohol-based technique Shuton, and her ninjutsu Strong Style strengthens her sixth sense and grants divine protection the more she drinks, letting her anticipate attacks, spot weaknesses, and unleash superhuman strength, making her terrifyingly resilient. She is a devoted fan of the chuhai Lilis Super Strong, which she always carries; drinking makes her a bit reckless."},"illustrator":"新堂エル","voiceActor":"和葉","forms":[{"id":"uni00458_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1072,2144],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[166,332],"def":[101,202],"spd":[48,48],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["3","1070001"],"evolve":[["evo00007",5],["evo00008",15],["evo00009",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"i